    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 🔍 What's Tracked\n\n- **New `.md` files** created in the past week\n- **Modified `.md` files** updated in the past week\n- **Project areas** with the most activity\n- **Changes broken down** by folder"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 📁 Quick Links\n\n- [[HOME|🏠 Home]]\n- [[30_WIKI/Dashboard/02_Recent|🕒 Recent Activity]]\n- [[30_WIKI/Dashboard/04_Projects|📂 Projects]]\n- [[30_WIKI/Dataview/Weekly-Monitor|📊 Weekly Monitor]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 📅 Sunday Review\n\n1. Open this canvas\n2. Click the **Weekly Monitor** link\n3. Review new & changed notes\n4. Process inbox items\n5. Update project status",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**Scope:** All `.md` files under `raw/` — excluding `.obsidian`, `04_Archive`, `90_Attachments`",
      "color": "2"
    }
  ],
